<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="32019002"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1470706638"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Beautiful Now"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Zedd / Jon Bellion"/><amll:meta key="album" value="True Colors"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:38.332"><div begin="00:02.590" end="03:33.765"><p begin="00:02.590" end="00:06.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">I see what you're wearing, there's nothing beneath it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我凝视着你，看透那不着纤尘的赤诚</span></p><p begin="00:06.327" end="00:09.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Forgive me for staring, forgive me for breathing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宽恕我的痴迷凝望，宽恕我近乎窒息的屏息</span></p><p begin="00:10.040" end="00:13.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">We might not know why, we might not know how<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无须追问缘由，亦无须探寻终点</span></p><p begin="00:13.861" end="00:17.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">But baby, tonight, we're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因今夜，宝贝，此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="00:17.586" end="00:21.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="00:21.365" end="00:24.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="00:25.069" end="00:28.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">We might not know why, we might not know how<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无须追问缘由，亦无须探寻终点</span></p><p begin="00:28.819" end="00:32.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">But, baby, tonight, we're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因今夜，宝贝，此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="00:32.505" end="00:36.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">We'll light up the sky, we'll open the clouds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将燃透苍穹，拨开重重阴云</span></p><p begin="00:36.355" end="00:41.216" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">'Cause, baby, tonight, we're beautiful now, we're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因今夜，宝贝，此刻我们正绚烂，如此绝美</span></p><p begin="00:55.097" end="00:56.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">We're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此绝美</span></p><p begin="01:09.999" end="01:13.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Wherever it's going, I'm gonna chase it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论前路何方，我定会奋力奔赴</span></p><p begin="01:13.780" end="01:17.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">What's left of this moment, I'm not gonna waste it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕只剩瞬息，我也绝不虚掷</span></p><p begin="01:17.688" end="01:21.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Stranded together, our worlds have collided<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">困守于此，我们的命运剧烈碰撞</span></p><p begin="01:21.358" end="01:24.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">This won't be forever, so why try to fight it?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然良辰易逝，又何必苦苦挣扎</span></p><p begin="01:25.058" end="01:28.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="01:28.798" end="01:32.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="01:32.574" end="01:36.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">We might not know why, we might not know how<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无须追问缘由，亦无须探寻终点</span></p><p begin="01:36.298" end="01:39.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">But, baby, tonight, we're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因今夜，宝贝，此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="01:40.076" end="01:43.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">We'll light up the sky, we'll open the clouds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将燃透苍穹，拨开重重阴云</span></p><p begin="01:43.785" end="01:48.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">'Cause, baby, tonight, we're beautiful now, we're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因今夜，宝贝，此刻我们正绚烂，如此绝美</span></p><p begin="02:02.587" end="02:03.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">We're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此绝美</span></p><p begin="02:34.459" end="02:37.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Let's live tonight like fireflies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让今夜的我们，如萤火般活过</span></p><p begin="02:38.229" end="02:41.474" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">And one by one, light up the sky<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点点微光汇聚，燃遍整座苍穹</span></p><p begin="02:41.979" end="02:45.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">We disappear and pass the crown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在消逝的瞬间，完成荣光的交接</span></p><p begin="02:45.689" end="02:47.577" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">You're beautiful, you're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你如此绚烂，你如此绝美</span></p><p begin="02:47.587" end="02:51.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="02:51.309" end="02:56.314" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">We're beautiful now (Beautiful)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="02:55.082" end="02:58.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="02:58.800" end="03:02.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="03:02.552" end="03:03.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">We're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此绝美</span></p><p begin="03:09.100" end="03:11.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">We're beautiful, we're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此绝美</span></p><p begin="03:17.577" end="03:21.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="03:21.331" end="03:23.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="03:25.090" end="03:28.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">We're beautiful now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p><p begin="03:28.871" end="03:33.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">We're beautiful now, we're beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我们正绚烂</span></p></div></body></tt>